  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You channel your <b>Power Surge</b> into a boost for your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Locomotion_System\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Locomotion System\">Locomotion System</a>. When you initiate a <b>Power Surge</b>, you can use one of the following bonuses with your installed <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Locomotion_System\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Locomotion System\">Locomotion System</a>:<br><br>You can use this Talent for a number of rounds equal to one-half your Character Level (rounded down). At the end of a <b>Power Boost</b>, you move -1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent\">Persistent</a> step on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. The penalties imposed by this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> persist until you receive <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Repairs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Repairs\">Repairs</a>. You can use both <b>Power Surge</b> and <b>Power Boost</b> at the same time, but you must move -2 Persistent steps on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>.",
